| SQL | No additional practice | Focus remained on enterprise architecture rather than syntax. |
| Data Storytelling | No progress today | Due to work priorities and enterprise AI training. |

# **Section III — Engineer Friday Reflection (After Action Review)**

### **Mission**

Build a stronger SQL foundation while beginning to understand how SQL fits into modern enterprise data engineering and analytics.

### **Planned**

- Continue SQLBolt lessons.

- Continue DataCamp Data Engineering Career Track.

- Continue LinkedIn Learning Data Storytelling.

- Observe technologies being used within NFCU.

- Continue connecting classroom concepts with real enterprise systems.

### **Accomplished**

